# Cloudflare Pages redirects for AlgoTheseus (primary host).
# PLACEHOLDER DOMAIN: replace https://www.example.com (and apex https://example.com)
# with the real production domain before launch. Same placeholder is used in
# index.html OG/canonical tags, public/sitemap.xml, public/robots.txt,
# public/site.webmanifest, and .env.production.example (VITE_SITE_URL).
# Keep the Netlify mirror equivalent in /netlify.toml [[redirects]] (sibling track).

